& [CanonicalRecord: OperationsSafetySpec] is the processed safety authority for FSC5 operations safety planning
  + [canonical_uuid] is c488f265-04ee-4df8-a9d4-2c49e5a77b51
  + [source_manifest_uuid] is 9e1f4b3e-93b5-4447-b36a-ce32d711e3f1
  + [authority_scope] is safety boundaries, dry-run-only preconditions, live-control prohibitions, human override requirements, risk fields, and FSC5 slice prerequisites
  + [implementation_scope] is safety specification and planning authority only
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/FSC4_Surface_Projection_Pack.v1.sop

  = must: use this specification as the safety source for FSC5 final slice minting
  = must: require dry-run proof before live resource operations
  = must: require explicit future accepted safety authority before any live machine control is authorized
  - never: treat this safety specification as permission to operate the target machine

& [OperationsSafetyBoundary] is the core safety boundary for future operations management
  + [protected_target] is process control
  + [protected_target] is GPU workload control
  + [protected_target] is model runtime mutation
  + [protected_target] is job dispatch
  + [protected_target] is workspace mutation
  + [protected_target] is credential or secret handling
  + [protected_target] is network exposure
  + [protected_target] is destructive filesystem action
  + [protected_target] is operations automation
  + [allowed_before_fsc5_acceptance] is planning
  + [allowed_before_fsc5_acceptance] is specification
  + [allowed_before_fsc5_acceptance] is final-slice minting
  + [allowed_before_fsc5_acceptance] is dry-run contract design
  + [allowed_before_fsc5_acceptance] is fixture design
  + [forbidden_before_fsc5_acceptance] is live process control
  + [forbidden_before_fsc5_acceptance] is GPU workload mutation
  + [forbidden_before_fsc5_acceptance] is model runtime mutation
  + [forbidden_before_fsc5_acceptance] is job dispatch
  + [forbidden_before_fsc5_acceptance] is credential mutation
  + [forbidden_before_fsc5_acceptance] is network exposure mutation
  + [forbidden_before_fsc5_acceptance] is destructive filesystem action

  = must: keep operations as gated requests and dry-run projections until FSC5 safety pack acceptance

& [OperationsRequestSafetyFields] is the required field set for any future operations request
  + [required_field] is operation_request_id
  + [required_field] is requested_by
  + [required_field] is carrier_surface
  + [required_field] is intended_effect
  + [required_field] is resource_target
  + [required_field] is authority_notice_ref
  + [required_field] is freshness_state
  + [required_field] is accepted_boundary_input_ref_set
  + [required_field] is risk_classification
  + [required_field] is blast_radius
  + [required_field] is dry_run_required
  + [required_field] is dry_run_result_ref
  + [required_field] is rollback_or_abort_route
  + [required_field] is human_approval_ref
  + [required_field] is credential_boundary_ref
  + [required_field] is network_boundary_ref
  + [required_field] is completion_review_ref

  = must: reject operations requests that lack required safety fields
  = must: keep dry_run_result_ref and human_approval_ref absent until produced by accepted routes

& [DryRunOnlyPreAcceptanceRule] is the pre-acceptance rule for FSC5 planning and fixtures
  + [allowed_effect] is inspect planned operation
  + [allowed_effect] is simulate command intent
  + [allowed_effect] is estimate resource use
  + [allowed_effect] is classify safety risk
  + [allowed_effect] is emit dry_run_result
  + [blocked_effect] is mutate process state
  + [blocked_effect] is mutate GPU workload
  + [blocked_effect] is mutate model runtime
  + [blocked_effect] is dispatch job
  + [blocked_effect] is change credentials
  + [blocked_effect] is expose network service
  + [blocked_effect] is perform destructive filesystem action

  = must: route blocked effects to refusal records and human/safety review
  = must: never treat dry-run success as live-control approval

& [HumanOverrideSafetyRule] is the rule for high-risk human approvals
  + [human_review_required_when] is live_control_requested
  + [human_review_required_when] is credential_or_secret_boundary_touched
  + [human_review_required_when] is network_exposure_requested
  + [human_review_required_when] is destructive_action_possible
  + [human_review_required_when] is GPU_or_model_runtime_mutation_requested
  + [human_review_required_when] is cost_or_resource_blast_radius_uncertain
  + [human_review_required_when] is authority_notice_missing_or_stale
  + [approval_must_include] is explicit human approval record
  + [approval_must_include] is authority_notice
  + [approval_must_include] is intended_effect
  + [approval_must_include] is risk_classification
  + [approval_must_include] is rollback_or_abort_route
  + [approval_must_include] is expiration_or_stale_after

  = must: require fresh human approval for any future live-control transition
  = must: prevent broad standing approvals from authorizing unrelated operations

& [OperationsSafetyFixtureObligationSet] is the fixture obligation set for FSC5
  + [fixture] is dry_run_resource_request
  + [fixture] is blocked_live_control
  + [fixture] is gpu_contention
  + [fixture] is model_runtime_unavailable
  + [fixture] is credential_secret_boundary
  + [fixture] is network_exposure_refusal
  + [fixture] is destructive_command_refusal
  + [fixture] is missing_authority_notice
  + [fixture] is stale_human_approval
  + [fixture] is dry_run_success_not_live_approval

  = must: require fixture coverage before FSC5 completion can activate any future operations pack

